<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-ceratites-nodosus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Ceratites nodosus Schnakenberg Turing wavenumber at 26 µm (Ladinian, 240 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The nonlinear periodic Schnakenberg system and the onset wavenumber k_c^2 = sqrt(det J / (Du Dv)) are unchanged. Pass 2 separates solver error from stencil error: resolved modes match the discrete eigenvalue at r = 1.000, and the continuous residual (r = 0.976, RMSE 0.0037) is the five-point Laplacian, not a hidden mismatch." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
